# BUGS

A role can't yet give an HDR peak in nits for an HDR output.
The light is always from the top left: there is no `light.angle` yet. A gradient has two colours, not more. Radharc's own decorations are drawn flat.
The check doesn't yet draw the kit frame at each scale or measure the theme's composition cost.
A part's ink is judged against its own fill only; ink on a transparent part is judged through the roles' pairs.
Graphite, Indigo Magic and the other themes of the look's family aren't written yet.
Platinum Indigo's gradients name colours rather than roles, so its high-contrast variant keeps their light ends.
